<title>USA: SyQuest unveils new internal drive.</title>
<headline>SyQuest unveils new internal drive.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>SyQuest Technology Thursday unveiled a new, internal enhanced IDE version of its award-winning EZFlyer 230 drive.</p>
<p>In a statement, SyQuest saids the EZFlyer 230 internal EIDE, the only removable cartridge hard drive available in this configuration, will plug directly into the same connector as the primary hard drive, requiring no additional hardware. The drive will be priced at $199 with initial shipments planned for April and volume delivery in May.</p>
</text>
